**File:** `/Users/gtrrz-victor/wks/cli/cli/e2e/testutil/assertions.go`

- `WaitForNoShadowBranches` (lines 125-138): Polls until all shadow branches (`entire/*` excluding `entire/checkpoints/*`) are cleaned up or timeout expires
